@firefly_wu/plugin-sdk is adapted from the Cyrene-Agent plugin SDK.

  Upstream project:  Cyrene-Agent
                     https://github.com/Playa-Cyrene/Cyrene-Agent
  Upstream package:  packages/plugin-sdk
                     (published on npm as @playa0v0/cyrene-plugin-sdk)
  Upstream author:   Copyright (c) 2026 Playa
  Upstream license:  MIT

The public contract types, the generated manifest schema, the manifest
validation entry point and the testing helpers in this package originate from
the upstream package. Firefly maintains an adapted fork for its own plugin
host: comments and identifiers have been rewritten, and host-specific
behaviour (for example the `plugin-agent` prompt-provider source and the
retired `moments-post` source) has been added on top.

This package stays under the MIT license. The MIT license requires the
upstream copyright notice and permission notice to be included in all copies
or substantial portions of the software, so both copyright holders are listed
in this package's `LICENSE` file and this notice ships in the published
tarball.

